--    lead's 11-17 13:31 / 13:32: 0391 is additive on its mssql_db_scoped_config), then the merge of this branch, then
--    lines 1, 3, 4, 8, 9 and 12 (tree.ts; the migrations' scope, purge and import lines; line 5 dropped 11-17), then
